      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LEKTRA ROSA (2) was among the minors three back at this track then missed the frame the last two, but drawn box 2 this time where she has won before. Meets a moderate line up and rates on top this time. BRINDLE ROAD (1) caught the eye with a fast early split and setting up a 3 length win at this track over 410m in 23.66. Has never been out of the placings from two starts out of this box. One of main contenders. NANGAR MACIE (5) did a good job to finish third last time out over 390m at Warrnambool (22.57) in a Grade 5, the second top-three finish on the trot. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. YONDU BALE (8) did a good job to finish second last time out over 410m at this track (23.67) in a Grade 5, the second top-three finish on the trot.",
